      "cooked": "<p>This is one of the options under stock settings.</p>\n<p>I want to know what is the difference between Rate and Price List Rate. I have been always using “Rate“ as the option. But I want to know how does it affect the PI or SI, when “Price List Rate” is enabled.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b0f492949f7baf52b658ebe90c0f013fa883ed4c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b0f492949f7baf52b658ebe90c0f013fa883ed4c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b0f492949f7baf52b658ebe90c0f013fa883ed4c.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pfq1NZQXttr8rzfrmDCfPRruZNq\" width=\"690\" height=\"208\" data-dominant-color=\"232323\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">712×215 9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
